  hints:
  - 'I am old, maybe ancient and come in many ways. Some good some bad. I am part
    of everybody, even when I am ignored by some. My form can be materialized in
    symbols and artistry. '
  - 'I was once who I was. Now I still am. And I always will be. '
  - 'When everyone looked toward us, I spoke so they could work '
  - 'I was always helping. Or rather, I was always helpful  '
